    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friend return to his home in the city, which after the nuclear war and the appearance of the &quot;Goro&quot; mutants will no longer be the same &quot;home&quot;. You will survive and fight with creatures that become more dangerous each new level. But you need to go through this to collect local riches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>   STARTMOVE IS: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic graphics, cut scenes, atmospheric sound design </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several missions - 1 hour of game time with various elements of the gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will be able to drive the car and survive with the first person view during the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 models of weapons in the game </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is The Indie game Wave-Shooter with elements of stealth, search, survival horror and its own story </p></li></ul>",
